# OLD SITE. The previous invictawatertreatment.co.uk was a Concrete5 site; the
# URLs below are taken from its sitemap.xml and navigation (October 2026), and
# from the Wayback Machine's record of the domain, which also turned up two
# earlier sites (see LEGACY SITES at the end).
# Each one 301s to the closest page on this site so search rankings and old
# bookmarks carry over. Netlify matches these with or without the trailing
# slash, and passes any query string through to the destination.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Concrete5 also served every page under /index.php/. Login and tool URLs go
# home; anything else drops the prefix and is caught again by the rules below.
/index.php/login/*   /         301
/index.php/tools/*   /         301
/index.php/*         /:splat   301
/index.php           /         301
/login/*             /         301

